### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health

### 单条地址解析
GET http://localhost:8000/api/format?address=闵行区古美路1458号

### 单条 - 完整地址
GET http://localhost:8000/api/format?address=朝阳区建国路88号1号楼2单元301室

### 单条 - 空地址
GET http://localhost:8000/api/format?address=

### 单条 - 缺少参数
GET http://localhost:8000/api/format


### 批量地址解析
POST http://localhost:8000/api/batch_format
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addresses": [
    "朝阳区建国路88号1号楼2单元301室",
    "闵行区华茂路32弄17号",
    "闵行区科苑路150弄3支弄6号楼3层302室"
  ]
}

### 批量 - 含空地址
POST http://localhost:8000/api/batch_format
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addresses": [
    "闵行区华茂路32弄17号",
    "",
    "朝阳区建国路88号"
  ]
}

### 批量 - 空数组
POST http://localhost:8000/api/batch_format
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addresses": []
}
